		(property "Description" "Main fan, Micro-Fit 3.0 compatible 1x4 right angle (fitted; Molex 43650-0400 also fits): 1 VCC, 2 GND, 3 PWM, 4 FG, as on the Dreame L60 Ultra PE main board (2x2-to-1x4 fan cable). MSD-G fan (Dreame X50). 5 A per contact: 4.2 A normal, firmware stops a stalled fan (FG). Place with room for the plug and cable on the mating side; check pin 1 against the header keying on the first board"
